<title>USA: Boston Chicken sees lower 97, 98 earnings.</title>
<headline>Boston Chicken sees lower 97, 98 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>GOLDEN, Colo. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston Chicken Inc said Wednesday it was seeing sales weakness so far in the second quarter and that earnings for 1997 and 1998 will be negatively impacted because it is opening fewer stores than it had originally anticipated.</p>
<p>&quot;During this transition period, we expect store performance to be choppy and are indeed seeing sales weakness this quarter,&quot; Mark Stephens, vice-president and chief financial officer, said in a written statement.</p>
</text>
